WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
LYNX SHARE opens Ableton Live sets: File, Open, then your .als.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.000
The tracks, the clips, the arrangement and Live's colours come over.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.600
Press Play to hear the arrangement, or launch clips in the grid.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.200
Live's devices become LYNX devices. Click a track for its Device view.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:31.200
Anything that could not come over is listed in Help, Last project import report.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.600
And File, Export, Ableton Live set takes your song back to Live.
